## Key Concepts

- Trie with per-node BST for subtree words by (freq, word)
- Global hash map for current frequencies
- Incremental updates propagate along word path; queryTopK uses node BST to fetch top-k quickly
- Trade-offs: memory factor for storing BSTs at every node vs. update cost

